Numerical format:

<type>numerical</type>
<question>[one numerical question]</question>
<answer>[one specific numeric value]</answer>

Regression format:

<type>regression</type>
<question>[one continuous-value estimation question]</question>
<answer>[one continuous value, with units when applicable]</answer>

